From 3488a7574c75e998dfccdb6fd568df929b0e92dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Weidong Sun <sunweidong@linux.alibaba.com>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 12:10:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 03/10] feat(alibabacloud): manage retained ESSD instances
 safely

Attach validated same-zone ESSD data disks as retained, non-bootable devices and reconcile ambiguous attach results. Reuse one client token across retries of a logical instance create, recover unknown success by tags, and clean up only instances and disks owned by that operation.

Require the cloud to report multi-attach as explicitly disabled at planning, reconciliation and cleanup boundaries so a disk cannot enter a state that later cleanup refuses to own.

Signed-off-by: Weidong Sun <sunweidong@linux.alibaba.com>
